 "pdfs": "public/design/downloads/*.pdf are part of the deliverable. They were excluded by the blanket *.pdf rule in .gitignore, in BOTH the import and the app, so a fresh clone received a design handoff missing two of its files while every check passed \u2014 because the checks read the working tree and the working tree had them. Negation rules now track them.",
